      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "OHTANI EXPRESS (1) looks close to another win after finishing second last time (22.61) at this track. Has never missed the frame here at the trip from seven starts. Although beaten ran one of the quickest times on the card last start. Can find winning form. BLOSSOMING FUN (2) showed blistering pace early and gave a sight when in the minors, beaten one length over 300m this track in 17.31. Comes out of a solid form race last start. Expected to feature. SUNSET SILENCE (3) has good early dash but last time was shuffled out the back and missed the frame, finishing eighth (23.39) in a Grade 5 at this track. Prior to that was quickly into stride and scored (23.39) at this track. Form here at this distance is sound. The form out of last race has been strong. Has ability and is one of the better chances. JINDONG EXPRESS (7) has a solid strike rate at this distance.",
